{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0309","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000017b:text","row":39979,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「……じー」","en":"“...Staaare.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904685","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00001","en":"Kiri: \"...staaare.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000019f:text","row":39980,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"ホコリを払う俺に、霧がガンを飛ばしたりメンチを切ったりしてくる。","en":"As I dusted myself off, Kiri kept giving me the stink eye and glaring daggers.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904686","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00002","en":"Dusting off dust and pride as I am, Kiri's sight is a bit trying to shoot at me as if her eyeballs were a gun, a bit trying to chop me like mincemeat.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","idiom_calque","grammar"],"assessment":"The narrator dusts himself off while Kiri glares daggers at him, described with two Japanese glare idioms. The English adds dusting off pride and expands the idioms into an incoherent sequence of literal eyeball gunfire and mincing.","remedy":"As I dust myself off, Kiri keeps shooting me vicious glares.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":150,"start":0,"text":"Dusting off dust and pride as I am, Kiri's sight is a bit trying to shoot at me as if her eyeballs were a gun, a bit trying to chop me like mincemeat."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000001ff:text","row":39981,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧……」","en":"“Kiri...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904687","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00003","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000221:text","row":39982,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"霧から行くか。","en":"Kiri first.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904688","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00004","en":"Shall I start with Kiri then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000026a:text","row":39983,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なんですか？」","en":"“...What?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904689","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00005","en":"Kiri: \"...what is it?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000296:text","row":39984,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"冷え冷えとした反応。顔つき。","en":"The answer was ice-cold. So was her face.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904690","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00006","en":"A fearfully cold reaction. Outwardly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000002ca:text","row":39985,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"目の前に立つ。","en":"I stood before her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904691","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00007","en":"I stand in front of her.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000002f0:text","row":39986,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"頭一つ分大きな俺に、臆さず目線を向けてくる。","en":"Though I was a full head taller, she met my eyes without flinching.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904692","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00008","en":"I stand a head taller than her, and yet she fearlessly directs her eyesight my way.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000334:text","row":39987,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"その意気や良し。","en":"Now that was the spirit.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904693","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00009","en":"That spirit will do just fine.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000364:text","row":39988,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「てやー」","en":"“Hyaa!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904694","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00010","en":"Taichi: \"T'eyaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000528:text","row":39989,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"アケスケー！","en":"OPEN SESAME!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904695","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00011","en":"Outspokehhh!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000581:text","row":39990,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「っっっ？？？」","en":"“Hhgh???”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904696","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00012","en":"Kiri: \"!!!???\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000005cc:text","row":39991,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、あれ？　あれれ？」","en":"“H-huh? Huh?!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904697","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00013","en":"Kiri: \"Wh-, what? Wha-what?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000061f:text","row":39992,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「ど、どうして戻らな……なっなっなっ？」","en":"“W-why won't it go back d-down? Wh-wh-what?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904698","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00014","en":"Kiri: \"Wh-, why doesn't it go down... eh, eh, eh?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000065f:text","row":39993,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"ばたばたとスカートを押さえつける。","en":"She frantically tried to press her skirt down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904699","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00015","en":"In a flap she flaps her skirt down,","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice","presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000699:text","row":39994,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"スカートはまったく落ち着こうとはしない。","en":"The skirt showed no intention of coming back down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904700","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00016","en":"But her skirt does not fall calm at all.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000006fc:text","row":39995,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「す、すかぁとがっ……ふわふわ浮いてっ、ちょっと、なにコレ！？」","en":"“M-my skirt... it's floating! Wait, what is this?!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904701","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00017","en":"Kiri: \"Sk-, the skiiirt... floating all fluffy! Really, what is this?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000779:text","row":39996,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふしぎ発見……」","en":"“Another mystery solved...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904702","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00018","en":"Miki: \"Inexplicable discovery...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000007ab:text","row":39997,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「手首のひねりが決め手だ」","en":"“It's all in the wrist.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904703","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Clincher's the twist in the wrist.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000800:text","row":39998,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「あぁあぁあぁぁぁあぁぁぁぁ……」","en":"“Aaaaaaaaah...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904704","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00020","en":"Kiri: \"AaAaAaaaAaaaah...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000083a:text","row":39999,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"あたふたあたふた。","en":"Panic, panic.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904705","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00021","en":"Feverish haste! Feverish haste!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000864:text","row":40000,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"ばさばさふさふさ。","en":"Flap, flap. Fluff, fluff.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904706","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00022","en":"Rustle rustle! Fluffy fluffy!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000008b1:text","row":40001,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「く、空気が抜けないっ」","en":"“Th-the air won’t come out!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904707","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00023","en":"Kiri: \"Th-, the air won't go out!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000008e9:text","row":40002,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「さて」","en":"“Now then.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904708","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Well then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000009e1:text","row":40003,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"美希を見る。","en":"I turned to Miki.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904709","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00025","en":"I look at Miki.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000a8b:text","row":40004,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「どき……」","en":"“Thump...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904710","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00026","en":"Miki: \"Badump...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000ab7:text","row":40005,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミニスカート大好きな娘っ子への、ちょっとはやいクリスマスプレゼント」","en":"“An early Christmas present for a miniskirt-loving girl.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904711","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00027","en":"Taichi: \"To a girlette that so loves her miniskirts, an early Christmas present is just desserts.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","logical_relation"],"assessment":"Taichi calls the skirt trick an early Christmas present for a miniskirt-loving girl. The English adds 'just deserts,' recasting the gift as deserved punishment.","remedy":"an early Christmas present for a girl who loves miniskirts","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":96,"start":53,"text":"an early Christmas present is just desserts"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000b9b:text","row":40006,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……わ、わたしにもアレを……？」","en":"“Ah... Y-you're going to do that... to me too?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904712","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00028","en":"Miki: \"Ah... y-, you will do 'that' to me too...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000bd7:text","row":40007,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"逃げ腰になる。","en":"She shrank back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904713","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00029","en":"She gets ready to flee.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000c22:text","row":40008,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ……いや……許して下さぁい」","en":"“Ah... no... Pleeease spare me.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904714","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00030","en":"Miki: \"Ah... no... please let me gooo!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000c62:text","row":40009,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「う」","en":"“Urk.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904715","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Ngh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000c80:text","row":40010,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"く、いたいけだぜ。","en":"D-damn. Too innocent.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904716","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00032","en":"Grrr, but she's so helpless dammit.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000cb2:text","row":40011,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「見逃してやりたいのは山々なのだが……許せよ」","en":"“I wish I could let you off... Forgive me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904717","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00033","en":"Taichi: \"I want to overlook this so badly I'd scale mountains to do so, but... forgive me.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The idiom means he very much wants to let her off. The English literalizes 山々 as mountains and invents a feat of climbing.","remedy":"I'd love nothing more than to let you off","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":70,"start":42,"text":"I'd scale mountains to do so"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000d1d:text","row":40012,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふわぁ、せ、先輩、落ち着いて……」","en":"“Taichi, p-please calm down...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904718","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00034","en":"Miki: \"Fwaaah, se-, Senpai, calm down...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000d59:text","row":40013,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"スカートの裾に指をかける。","en":"I hooked my fingers under the hem of her skirt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904719","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00035","en":"I lay fingers on the hem of her skirt.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000db0:text","row":40014,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「美希の大好きな先輩はそんなことしませんよね？」","en":"“You wouldn’t do something like that to a girl who adores you, would you?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904720","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00036","en":"Miki: \"The Senpai that Miki likes so much wouldn't do this, right?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000df8:text","row":40015,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"じっ、と見つめられる。","en":"She stared straight into my eyes.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904721","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00037","en":"Stare!, and I am gazed at fixedly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000e2e:text","row":40016,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904722","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00038","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000e4e:text","row":40017,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"少女の叫びに、心が動いた。","en":"Her plea moved me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904723","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00039","en":"The screaming of girls moves my heart.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese refers to this one girl's appeal or cry moving him. The English changes it into plural girls screaming generally.","remedy":"The girl's cry moves my heart.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":22,"start":0,"text":"The screaming of girls"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000e80:text","row":40018,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"その小さな腰をバックで滅茶苦茶に突き押してやりたい。","en":"I wanted to bend her over and pound her senseless.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904724","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00040","en":"From the back of those tiny hips I want to make wanton push'n'shove.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","undertranslation"],"assessment":"The source expresses a desire to thrust violently into her small hips from behind. The English lacks a grammatical object and reduces the sexual action to generic pushing and shoving.","remedy":"I want to pound those little hips mercilessly from behind.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":68,"start":0,"text":"From the back of those tiny hips I want to make wanton push'n'shove."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000ecc:text","row":40019,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"愛しているから壊したい。","en":"I wanted to break her because I loved her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904725","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00041","en":"Love, therefore desire to break.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000efc:text","row":40020,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"大好きだからイジメタイ。","en":"I wanted to torment her because I adored her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904726","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00042","en":"I like a lot, therefore I want to bully.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000f2c:text","row":40021,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"男心は複雑なのだ。","en":"Men are complicated creatures.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904727","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00043","en":"The construction of the male heart is complicated indeed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00000fdc:text","row":40022,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「人はなぜ争わなければならないんですか！」","en":"“Why must people fight?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904728","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00044","en":"Miki: \"Why do people always need to find it in themselves to fight!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000101e:text","row":40023,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"くっ、その通りだ。","en":"Damn. She was right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904729","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00045","en":"Grrr, it is as she says.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00001048:text","row":40024,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"まったく関係ないが正当な疑問だ。","en":"Completely irrelevant, but a perfectly valid question.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904730","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00046","en":"It's got zilch to do with this but it's a reasonable thing to ask.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00001080:text","row":40025,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"美希のピュアな言葉が俺を目覚めさせた。","en":"Miki's innocent words brought me to my senses.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904731","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00047","en":"The purity in Miki's words made me awake.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says her pure words awakened him or brought him to his senses. The causative requires the verb 'wake,' not the adjective 'awake.'","remedy":"woke me up","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":40,"start":27,"text":"made me awake"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000010c6:text","row":40026,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「わかったよ、美希」","en":"“All right, Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904732","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00048","en":"Taichi: \"I understand, Miki.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:00001178:text","row":40027,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、よかった」","en":"“I'm so glad, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904733","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00049","en":"Miki: \"Senpai, I'm so glad!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:000011a2:text","row":40028,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"霧にも頭を下げよう。","en":"Time to apologize to Kiri too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904734","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00050","en":"I also bow my head to Kiri.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000128e:text","row":40029,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「やーやー霧、ゴメン！」","en":"“Hey, Kiri—sorry!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904735","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00051","en":"Taichi: \"Yeah, yeeeah, Kiri, sorries!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0309:0000148b:text","row":40030,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「ゴメンじゃなーーーーーーーいっ！！」","en":"“SORRY DOESN'T CUT IT!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904736","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0016a:00052","en":"Kiri: \"Don't you 'sorries' MEEEEEEEE!!!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
